              "text": "صاف کردن (sâf kardan) — \"to strain, to filter; to smooth\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "چای را صاف کرد و در لیوان ریخت. Chây râ sâf kard va dar livân rikht. She strained the tea and poured it into a glass."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also \"to smooth, to straighten\". Present sâf mikonad."
            }
          ]
        },
